e displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n<p>Therefore, we have the following system:</p>\n